    tube T=2 (8 plaq)    n=  8 links= 16 mult_prod=     1  c_f/u=N=2  |w|^(1/n)/u =   2.0000
    tube T=3 (12 plaq)   n= 12 links= 24 mult_prod=     1  c_f/u=N=2  |w|^(1/n)/u =   2.0000
    => Cbar >= N exactly (mult_prod>=1), i.e. NOT O(1): Cbar >= 2 at N=2, before any tree factor

