    eDelta = e*20 = 54.3656
    KEY: beta1^fix = 2N^2/(Chat eDelta Cbar).  With Cbar = O(1) it scales as N^2 -> WRONG.
         With Cbar = 2N^2 * Delta it is N-independent, and beta1^fix = 1/(Chat eDelta e^beta).
    NOTE: Cbar_sharp = Phi(0)/u = 2N^2 (no extra Delta: trees already counted by lambda_a=eDelta)
          Cbar <= 20 holds only for 2N^2 <= 20  <=>  N <= 3.16  =>  FAILS for N >= 4
